bm-engine is a port to Zig / WebAssembly of takumi (https://github.com/kane50613/takumi):

    takumi
    Copyright (c) 2025 Kane Wang
    Licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option.

Large parts of bm-engine are transliterations of takumi's Rust code (layout, painting, text, CSS,
Tailwind, HTML, SVG, animation, codecs); bm-engine is therefore a derivative work of takumi and keeps
its copyright notice in LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE.

takumi in turn follows Chromium's Blink renderer and Skia in many places, and bm-engine ports or follows
further third-party code, algorithms and data. The notices they require are reproduced in
